WEBVTT

00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:07.331
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:12.303
I, Hikaru Shidou,
along with Umi and Fuu...

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:16.507
...was summoned once again
to Cephiro, another world.

00:00:16.611 --> 00:00:21.344
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:24.213
...and was facing total destruction.

00:00:25.253 --> 00:00:28.154
Chizeta has backed
down from Cephiro...

00:00:28.256 --> 00:00:32.852
...and with Fahren's princess,
Aska, also giving up on being Pillar...

00:00:32.961 --> 00:00:36.556
...we were all pleased
from the bottom of our hearts.

00:00:37.365 --> 00:00:42.701
Eagle from Autozam, another
invading country, promised to stay...

00:00:43.238 --> 00:00:50.701
...and keep Cephiro from destruction
if he's qualified to become the Pillar.

00:00:52.647 --> 00:00:58.108
However, most of the land other
than the castle has been destroyed.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.017
We have no time left.

00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:08.120
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:12.930
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:13.668 --> 00:01:18.332
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.510
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.554
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:34.988
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:37.058 --> 00:01:39.583
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:40.629 --> 00:01:45.734
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:49.500
...inside my heart.

00:01:50.205 --> 00:01:53.766
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:54.643 --> 00:02:00.013
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:03.985 --> 00:02:07.682
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:12.356
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:17.863
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.036
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:28.231
...a future that has no end.

00:02:31.246 --> 00:02:37.207
The True Pillar Is: Hikaru or Eagle!?

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.879
The crown is changing its shape.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.880
Because one worthy of becoming
the Pillar has entered that room.

00:03:09.985 --> 00:03:12.749
Is it the one from Autozam, or...

00:03:17.158 --> 00:03:18.887
...is it Hikaru?

00:03:30.271 --> 00:03:31.397
Hikaru...

00:03:43.151 --> 00:03:44.550
You're...

00:04:04.906 --> 00:04:06.339
Lady Aska!

00:04:07.342 --> 00:04:09.606
The tremors are getting worse.

00:04:09.978 --> 00:04:13.106
I am worried about
the residential quarter.

00:04:16.284 --> 00:04:18.752
Monsters might reappear.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:22.087
Where Cephiro's people
have been evacuated?

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.248
Right.

00:04:23.358 --> 00:04:24.825
We'll go too.

00:04:24.926 --> 00:04:27.019
We might be able to help.

00:04:27.128 --> 00:04:28.755
I will as well.

00:04:28.863 --> 00:04:30.057
Thank you.

00:04:30.165 --> 00:04:31.894
Thank you very much.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:38.633
We'll look for Hikaru at Clef's. Ferio, take
the residential quarter with the others.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.074
Right.

00:04:39.074 --> 00:04:39.874
Right.
Fuu.

00:04:39.874 --> 00:04:40.898
Right.
Fuu.
Yes.

00:04:51.219 --> 00:04:52.151
Ms. Umi!

00:04:52.253 --> 00:04:53.845
Umi!

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:57.285
Beast Summon!

00:05:15.844 --> 00:05:18.472
You're one of Ascot's friends.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.979
Thank you.

00:05:22.183 --> 00:05:23.172
Umi!

00:05:25.386 --> 00:05:26.654
Are you all right?

00:05:26.654 --> 00:05:27.848
Are you all right?
I'm fine.

00:05:31.726 --> 00:05:34.286
You keep saving me, Ascot.

00:05:34.395 --> 00:05:35.487
Thank you.

00:05:36.965 --> 00:05:39.092
Are you all right, Ms. Umi?

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.098
Yes.

00:05:40.201 --> 00:05:42.635
But why did the wall suddenly...

00:05:43.538 --> 00:05:47.668
Has the crumbling of Cephiro
finally begun affecting the castle?

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.074
You will stay in Cephiro?

00:05:54.482 --> 00:05:59.749
If I'm able to become the Pillar, I'll stay
in Cephiro to ensure its stability.

00:05:59.854 --> 00:06:05.053
That is, if you'll allow Autozam
engineers to analyze the Pillar system.

00:06:07.795 --> 00:06:10.992
I have no time for ploys.

00:06:13.668 --> 00:06:18.537
I heard from Lantis that you're
the supreme sorcerer in Cephiro.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.904
I'm sure you'll understand.

00:06:33.254 --> 00:06:36.280
You are gravely ill.

00:06:36.824 --> 00:06:41.761
Yes. The doctors told me
I wouldn't make it to Cephiro alive.

00:06:52.407 --> 00:06:53.499
Eagle...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.570
...was it?

00:06:56.678 --> 00:06:57.940
Yes.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:03.244
The same aura as Lantis...
A truly strong warrior's aura.

00:07:04.252 --> 00:07:08.416
You can keep the illness at bay
and stand there for your country.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.894
And for something else.

00:07:17.098 --> 00:07:20.329
I will decide how I live.

00:07:20.501 --> 00:07:22.765
And how I die.

00:07:23.438 --> 00:07:27.738
Even if I am ill, I don't intend
to just wait for the end.

00:07:27.842 --> 00:07:32.211
I am a fighter. When I die,
it will be as a warrior.

00:07:32.313 --> 00:07:33.541
Eagle...

00:07:33.648 --> 00:07:34.910
All right.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:38.583
The proof of the Pillar will soon
change shape completely...

00:07:38.686 --> 00:07:41.018
...to best suit the next Pillar.

00:07:41.122 --> 00:07:44.717
At that time, we will
know who the true Pillar is.

00:07:45.593 --> 00:07:48.118
What will you do then, Hikaru?

00:07:50.765 --> 00:07:52.198
If I...

00:07:54.636 --> 00:07:59.300
If I'm qualified to become
the Pillar of this world...

00:08:03.378 --> 00:08:04.504
Clef!

00:08:05.546 --> 00:08:08.674
Clef, the castle itself
has begun to crumble!

00:08:08.783 --> 00:08:13.379
Ferio and those from Chizeta and
Fahren are at the residential quarter...

00:08:19.661 --> 00:08:20.889
Eagle...

00:08:54.996 --> 00:08:56.691
T-Thank you...

00:09:06.074 --> 00:09:10.010
If we do our best,
even we can protect someone.

00:09:28.896 --> 00:09:30.363
Lord Zagato...

00:09:31.199 --> 00:09:32.496
Alcyone...

00:09:34.569 --> 00:09:37.163
Please, tell me, Alcyone...

00:09:37.271 --> 00:09:39.102
Where is the enemy?

00:09:39.207 --> 00:09:43.007
I'm sick of this...
I don't want to keep living...

00:09:43.111 --> 00:09:45.773
...in this world without Lord Zagato.

00:09:46.514 --> 00:09:47.845
Alcyone...

00:10:08.069 --> 00:10:11.470
You look much prettier with a smile.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.901
I'm sure Lantis will be back.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.840
It's all right.

00:10:24.719 --> 00:10:27.210
He's pretty tough
despite appearances.

00:10:27.321 --> 00:10:29.915
It takes more than
a little to break him.

00:10:31.759 --> 00:10:34.159
Lantis loves you.

00:10:36.898 --> 00:10:39.662
Lantis isn't like his elder brother.

00:10:39.867 --> 00:10:44.770
Because if there's someone
he loves, he'll come back alive for her.

00:10:58.085 --> 00:11:00.679
I will keep my promise.

00:11:04.892 --> 00:11:05.859
Eagle.

00:11:27.081 --> 00:11:28.309
Eagle...

00:11:30.618 --> 00:11:35.749
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:37.625 --> 00:11:41.755
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:50.872 --> 00:11:53.966
Damn it, that huge kid balloon.

00:11:54.308 --> 00:11:57.903
It took me longer than
expected to do the repairs!

00:11:58.145 --> 00:11:59.373
Eagle...

00:12:02.016 --> 00:12:03.916
Geo! It's the FTO!

00:12:04.018 --> 00:12:05.007
What?

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.454
It's Eagle!
Only Eagle can properly pilot it!

00:12:18.266 --> 00:12:19.392
Eagle!

00:12:25.206 --> 00:12:26.730
Hikaru is...

00:12:27.408 --> 00:12:30.707
Ms. Hikaru is the Pillar of Cephiro?

00:12:34.348 --> 00:12:36.782
It's not decided yet.

00:12:36.884 --> 00:12:41.651
Me or Eagle... It seems
one of us can become the Pillar.

00:12:43.391 --> 00:12:47.122
The crown in that room
is starting to change its shape.

00:12:47.228 --> 00:12:50.391
To the shape that
best suits the next Pillar...

00:12:50.498 --> 00:12:54.696
That means we're
responsible for the future of Cephiro.

00:12:55.469 --> 00:13:00.099
I haven't said anything about the
Pillar system of Cephiro until now...

00:13:00.207 --> 00:13:02.801
...because I wasn't really involved.

00:13:04.445 --> 00:13:06.879
I don't know who summoned us.

00:13:07.548 --> 00:13:10.312
I don't know when we're going back.

00:13:10.751 --> 00:13:15.620
I didn't think someone in that position
could say anything about this country.

00:13:16.757 --> 00:13:21.922
But if you are a Pillar candidate,
then we are also responsible.

00:13:22.997 --> 00:13:28.993
To me, the Pillar is just a sacrifice
for the peace and order of the world.

00:13:29.637 --> 00:13:34.506
If the populace is happy, then it
doesn't matter if each individual is?

00:13:36.077 --> 00:13:41.481
I absolutely do not want you
to end up like Princess Emeraude.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:43.708
Umi...

00:13:44.118 --> 00:13:45.312
Fuu...

00:13:46.153 --> 00:13:51.284
I don't think anyone else
should ever feel like we did either.

00:13:53.194 --> 00:13:57.460
I heard from Clef too.
If I'm able to become the Pillar...

00:13:57.965 --> 00:14:01.924
If I'm able to change
Cephiro into whatever I want...

00:14:03.037 --> 00:14:05.301
Clef said it was all right.

00:14:05.406 --> 00:14:07.374
I want Cephiro to...

00:14:07.475 --> 00:14:08.737
Hikaru!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:09.844
Umi!

00:14:09.844 --> 00:14:11.209
Umi!
Fuu!

00:14:11.912 --> 00:14:13.004
Rayearth!

00:14:13.814 --> 00:14:14.678
Selece!

00:14:14.749 --> 00:14:15.647
Windam!

00:14:15.716 --> 00:14:17.183
Look outside!

00:14:23.724 --> 00:14:24.884
That's...

00:14:34.702 --> 00:14:35.760
Nova!

00:15:01.162 --> 00:15:02.254
Nova...

00:15:03.898 --> 00:15:05.092
Hikaru...

00:15:05.933 --> 00:15:07.867
That's my heart...

00:15:08.536 --> 00:15:10.504
Nova, where's Lantis?

00:15:10.604 --> 00:15:12.003
Lantis is mine.

00:15:12.106 --> 00:15:13.198
Nova!

00:15:13.307 --> 00:15:16.276
I hate everything you love, Hikaru!

00:15:22.183 --> 00:15:24.651
I hate them all!

00:15:26.253 --> 00:15:29.279
Nova, that's not it! I... I...

00:15:42.069 --> 00:15:45.004
All right!
Nothing was broken this time!

00:15:54.515 --> 00:15:56.346
I've returned.

00:15:58.486 --> 00:16:00.920
Why didn't you contact us?

00:16:01.255 --> 00:16:03.280
I forgot the communicator.

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.688
You trying to piss me off?

00:16:05.793 --> 00:16:10.321
No, I know best of all how scary
you are when you're angry.

00:16:10.431 --> 00:16:11.365
Why you...

00:16:11.365 --> 00:16:12.133
Why you...
I've made a truce with Cephiro.

00:16:12.133 --> 00:16:14.101
I've made a truce with Cephiro.

00:16:15.236 --> 00:16:16.726
Eagle! Geo!

00:16:17.972 --> 00:16:22.409
Hikaru's team of Rune-Gods are
battling that other Rune-God from before!

00:16:43.264 --> 00:16:44.526
Ms. Hikaru!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:50.068
Ice Blade!

00:16:54.308 --> 00:16:55.400
What?

00:17:00.447 --> 00:17:05.578
Emerald Cyclone!

00:17:11.025 --> 00:17:13.255
Umi, Fuu, that magic...

00:17:13.828 --> 00:17:16.592
A new spell. I just learned it.

00:17:16.697 --> 00:17:18.460
Myself as well.

00:17:22.136 --> 00:17:23.194
Why?

00:17:23.604 --> 00:17:26.539
I'm doing this all for you, Hikaru!

00:17:26.841 --> 00:17:28.103
Nova...

00:17:28.409 --> 00:17:32.812
You wondered if people could only
be with their loved ones in death...

00:17:32.913 --> 00:17:36.110
...when you were
fighting Princess Emeraude after all.

00:17:36.217 --> 00:17:37.343
That's why...

00:17:37.451 --> 00:17:41.547
That's why I'm killing everyone
you love for your sake, Hikaru!

00:17:45.926 --> 00:17:47.917
Ruby Lightning!

00:17:48.128 --> 00:17:50.187
Ruby Lightning!

00:17:54.268 --> 00:17:56.532
Nova's a part of my heart.

00:17:58.005 --> 00:18:00.303
A shadow created by a heart...

00:18:00.407 --> 00:18:03.570
...that couldn't stand
killing Princess Emeraude.

00:18:04.245 --> 00:18:05.769
Your heart's...

00:18:06.513 --> 00:18:07.537
...shadow?

00:18:13.187 --> 00:18:14.950
I will kill you!

00:18:17.258 --> 00:18:18.555
Lightning...

00:18:24.031 --> 00:18:25.328
...Call!

00:18:39.446 --> 00:18:40.777
That magic...

00:18:40.881 --> 00:18:43.543
Yeah, it's Lantis's magic.

00:18:45.252 --> 00:18:46.412
Why?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.612
Because...

00:18:55.229 --> 00:18:58.027
Lantis!

00:18:59.066 --> 00:19:00.829
Lightning Call!

00:19:11.779 --> 00:19:13.406
I'm going out.

00:19:13.514 --> 00:19:14.776
To where?

00:19:14.949 --> 00:19:17.042
If Lantis is trapped inside...

00:19:17.151 --> 00:19:20.848
...Hikaru's team
won't be able to attack.

00:19:21.455 --> 00:19:24.219
At this rate, Nova will kill them all.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:29.194
Zazu! Please open the hatch!

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:31.157
B-But, Eagle...

00:19:31.265 --> 00:19:32.466
Please open it!

00:19:32.466 --> 00:19:34.024
Please open it!
R-Right.

00:19:37.871 --> 00:19:39.031
Eagle!

00:19:41.275 --> 00:19:42.367
Eagle...

00:19:44.912 --> 00:19:46.470
Lifting off...

00:19:49.483 --> 00:19:51.178
I won't let you go!

00:19:51.285 --> 00:19:54.220
The only place you're
going is the medical bay!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:01.124
I really wanted to find
Autozam's future with these hands...

00:20:02.796 --> 00:20:05.230
...but it seems time has run out.

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:11.168
Master Mage Clef of
Cephiro has promised...

00:20:11.772 --> 00:20:16.300
...to aid Autozam in rebuilding
whether or not I am the Pillar.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:20.244
Therefore, I cannot let
the Magic Knights die.

00:20:21.048 --> 00:20:22.140
I'll go!

00:20:22.249 --> 00:20:24.342
No, I will go.

00:20:27.321 --> 00:20:31.155
When I die, I will die as a warrior.

00:20:31.258 --> 00:20:33.192
That is my wish.

00:20:34.895 --> 00:20:37.386
It's for Lantis, isn't it...

00:20:41.268 --> 00:20:43.702
The FTO is ready for launch!

00:20:45.072 --> 00:20:47.973
As of this moment,
command of the NSX...

00:20:48.075 --> 00:20:51.875
...will be transferred
to Geo Metro, the subcommander.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.147
Eagle!

00:20:54.481 --> 00:20:58.918
The true enemy of Cephiro seems
to be more than just that girl Nova.

00:20:59.019 --> 00:21:02.011
Please use this ship to save Cephiro.

00:21:04.191 --> 00:21:08.287
I'm sorry that I'm being
selfish until the very end.

00:21:17.271 --> 00:21:19.933
Eagle!

00:21:20.974 --> 00:21:23.408
FTO... Go.

00:21:37.458 --> 00:21:38.482
Lantis...

00:21:39.026 --> 00:21:42.962
Hikaru, let's play with Lantis,
the three of us together.

00:21:53.841 --> 00:21:54.967
Eagle!

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:02.376
May I join you?

00:22:13.527 --> 00:22:20.660
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:21.401 --> 00:22:30.173
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:32.246 --> 00:22:38.344
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:44.783
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:47.261 --> 00:22:52.893
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:54.568 --> 00:22:59.596
...keep welling up.

00:23:01.909 --> 00:23:07.643
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:09.183 --> 00:23:14.382
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:16.523 --> 00:23:23.656
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:24.331 --> 00:23:32.966
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:48.155 --> 00:23:52.353
Hikaru, Lantis is together
with us. Let's play together.

00:23:52.459 --> 00:23:53.551
Lantis...

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:59.530
Hikaru, at this rate,
everyone you love will die here.

00:23:59.633 --> 00:24:00.657
Ms. Hikaru!

00:24:00.767 --> 00:24:01.791
Hikaru!

00:24:02.269 --> 00:24:05.261
Next time on Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.372 --> 00:24:06.964
An Endless Battle!

00:24:07.074 --> 00:24:09.269
Lantis!

00:24:09.543 --> 00:24:13.547
An Endless Battle!

00:24:13.547 --> 00:24:21.477
Who is it today?

00:24:21.688 --> 00:24:23.451
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:23.557 --> 00:24:24.191
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.191 --> 00:24:26.493
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.493 --> 00:24:28.328
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:28.328 --> 00:24:29.522
Look forward to the next episode!
